              "word": "云",
              "reason": "no_weather_phrase",
              "matched": []
            }
          ],
          "v2_borderline_only": false,
          "body": "这云看着要下雨。手里这把椅子还差最后一道榫，得赶在潮气上来前收好。慢工出细活。"
        },
        {
          "msg_uid": "42:73",
          "day": 0,
          "legacy_words": [
            "晴"
          ],
          "v2_is_weather": true,
          "v2_kept_strong": [
            "晴"
          ],
          "v2_kept_words": [],
          "v2_kept_phrases": [],
          "v2_dropped": [],
          "v2_borderline_only": false,
          "body": "这开春半阴半晴的，你那炉子今天顺不顺当？我这儿一屉枣泥酥总差点意思，想跟你讨个准头。你手上忙着呢？"
        },
        {
          "msg_uid": "42:84",
          "day": 0,
          "legacy_words": [
            "晒"
          ],
          "v2_is_weather": false,
          "v2_kept_strong": [],
          "v2_kept_words": [],
          "v2_kept_phrases": [],
          "v2_dropped": [
            {
              "word": "晒",
              "reason": "denylist_compound",
              "matched": [
                "晒干"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "v2_borderline_only": false,
          "body": "哎，这黄芪片子切得薄是薄了点，可晒干了药性才出得来，急不得吧。"
        },
        {
          "msg_uid": "42:189",
          "day": 0,
          "legacy_words": [
            "云"
          ],
          "v2_is_weather": false,
          "v2_kept_strong": [],
          "v2_kept_words": [],
          "v2_kept_phrases": [],
          "v2_dropped": [
            {
              "word": "云",
              "reason": "no_weather_phrase",
              "matched": []
            }
          ],
          "v2_borderline_only": false,
          "body": "今儿这云看着要散不散的，你那边灶上还顺当吧？我这儿正拿老李家的豆腐试手，想少放点酱、多搁一撮糖，看能不能把那股豆腥压下去。火候还得再盯盯。"
        },
        {
          "msg_uid": "42:831",
          "day": 0,
          "legacy_words": [
            "潮气"
          ],
          "v2_is_weather": true,
          "v2_kept_strong": [
            "潮气"
          ],
          "v2_kept_words": [],
          "v2_kept_phrases": [],
          "v2_dropped": [],
          "v2_borderline_only": false,
          "body": "哟，正拿砂纸磨这旧砚台呢，春天潮气重，不拾掇怕是要起霉斑——你家那方砚台还搁着没动吧？"
        },
        {
          "msg_uid": "42:3601",
          "day": 0,
          "legacy_words": [
            "晴"
          ],
          "v2_is_weather": true,
          "v2_kept_strong": [
            "晴"
          ],
          "v2_kept_words": [],
          "v2_kept_phrases": [],
          "v2_dropped": [],
          "v2_borderline_only": false,
          "body": "这春天半阴半晴的，我刚把上个月的账本翻出来对了一遍，想着再省点，年底那笔定期就能凑齐了。你家最近开销大不大？"
        },
        {
          "msg_uid": "42:4869",
          "day": 0,
          "legacy_words": [
            "云"
          ],
          "v2_is_weather": true,
          "v2_kept_strong": [],
          "v2_kept_words": [
            "云"
          ],
          "v2_kept_phrases": [
            "云厚"
          ],
          "v2_dropped": [],
          "v2_borderline_only": false,
          "body": "云厚是厚，地里的墒情倒还成，我给阿禾捎把新蒜苗吧。"
        },
        {
          "msg_uid": "42:4946",
          "day": 0,
          "legacy_words": [
            "晒"
          ],
          "v2_is_weather": false,
          "v2_kept_strong": [],
          "v2_kept_words": [],
          "v2_kept_phrases": [],
          "v2_dropped": [
            {
              "word": "晒",
              "reason": "denylist_compound",
              "matched": [
                "晒的"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "v2_borderline_only": false,
          "body": "哎，阿禾，我这儿多带了一小包去年晒的桂花干，你拿回去泡水喝吧。"
        },
        {
          "msg_uid": "42:5065",
          "day": 0,
          "legacy_words": [
            "云"
          ],
          "v2_is_weather": true,
          "v2_kept_strong": [],
          "v2_kept_words": [
            "云"
          ],
          "v2_kept_phrases": [
            "云彩"
          ],
          "v2_dropped": [],
          "v2_borderline_only": false,
          "body": "云彩压着炉子，火苗都蔫。我正给张家那把锄头回火，铁还没红透。那小子蹲就蹲吧。"
        },
        {
          "msg_uid": "42:6004",
          "day": 0,
          "legacy_words": [
            "晒"
          ],
          "v2_is_weather": false,
          "v2_kept_strong": [],
          "v2_kept_words": [],
          "v2_kept_phrases": [],
          "v2_dropped": [
            {
              "word": "晒",
              "reason": "denylist_compound",
              "matched": [
                "晒好"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "v2_borderline_only": false,
          "body": "这阵子忙得过来吗？我这儿多带了一小包晒好的陈皮，想着你泡水喝正好，顺路给你搁门口了。你最近是不是又熬夜了？"
        },
        {
          "msg_uid": "42:18789",
          "day": 1,
          "legacy_words": [
            "阴天"
          ],
          "v2_is_weather": true,
          "v2_kept_strong": [
            "阴天"
          ],
          "v2_kept_words": [],
          "v2_kept_phrases": [],
          "v2_dropped": [],
          "v2_borderline_only": false,
          "body": "这阴天闷得人发慌，我正给西头老赵家修犁头呢，你那边咋样了？"
        },
        {
          "msg_uid": "42:19103",
          "day": 1,
          "legacy_words": [
            "天阴"
          ],
          "v2_is_weather": true,
          "v2_kept_strong": [
            "天阴"
          ],
          "v2_kept_words": [],
          "v2_kept_phrases": [],
          "v2_dropped": [],
          "v2_borderline_only": false,
          "body": "老周，你这咳嗽拖了半个月，我给你配的枇杷叶膏子得按时吃，别嫌苦就搁下了。今儿天阴，气管更受不住。药得吃完。"
        },
        {
          "msg_uid": "42:19322",
          "day": 1,
          "legacy_words": [
            "阴着",
            "天阴"
          ],
          "v2_is_weather": true,
          "v2_kept_strong": [
            "阴着",
            "天阴"
          ],
          "v2_kept_words": [],
          "v2_kept_phrases": [],
          "v2_dropped": [],
          "v2_borderline_only": false,
          "body": "这天阴着倒不碍事，我把南街那户的契书摊在桌上晾着呢，先抽你一张薄棉纸垫底下。"
        },
        {
          "msg_uid": "42:19671",
          "day": 1,
          "legacy_words": [
            "阴天"
          ],
          "v2_is_weather": true,
          "v2_kept_strong": [
            "阴天"
          ],
          "v2_kept_words": [],
          "v2_kept_phrases": [],
          "v2_dropped": [],
          "v2_borderline_only": false,
          "body": "这阴天里你蹲在门口磨啥呢，是给谁家赶的活计？"
        },
        {
          "msg_uid": "42:21824",
          "day": 1,
          "legacy_words": [
            "潮气"
          ],
          "v2_is_weather": true,
          "v2_kept_strong": [
            "潮气"
          ],
          "v2_kept_words": [],
          "v2_kept_phrases": [],
          "v2_dropped": [],
          "v2_borderline_only": false,
          "body": "我这儿刚把西头那垄的豆角架绑完，手还沾着泥，你收萝卜干别让潮气返上来吧。"
        },
        {
          "msg_uid": "42:23960",
          "day": 1,
          "legacy_words": [
            "风"
          ],
          "v2_is_weather": false,
          "v2_kept_strong": [],
          "v2_kept_words": [],
          "v2_kept_phrases": [],
          "v2_dropped": [
            {
              "word": "风",
              "reason": "no_weather_phrase",
              "matched": []
            }
          ],
          "v2_borderline_only": false,
          "body": "这布条颜色倒鲜亮，我拿它把窗台上那盆蒜苗绑一绑，省得风一吹就倒。"
        },
        {
          "msg_uid": "42:24011",
          "day": 1,
          "legacy_words": [
            "阴天"
          ],
          "v2_is_weather": true,
          "v2_kept_strong": [
            "阴天"
          ],
          "v2_kept_words": [],
          "v2_kept_phrases": [],
          "v2_dropped": [],
          "v2_borderline_only": false,
          "body": "这阴天闷得人心里发潮，我这儿正把刘家那袋木耳倒出来挑沙子呢，你说干货的事，是等陈家老太太那锅牛腩吃完再说，还是我明儿一早给你送过去？"
        },
        {
          "msg_uid": "42:24853",
          "day": 1,
          "legacy_words": [
            "阴天"
          ],
          "v2_is_weather": true,
          "v2_kept_strong": [
            "阴天"
          ],
          "v2_kept_words": [],
          "v2_kept_phrases": [],
          "v2_dropped": [],
          "v2_borderline_only": false,
          "body": "这阴天闷得人心里发沉，我正给李家的小孙子分药，一包一包数着呢。萝卜糕先搁桌上吧。"
        },
        {
          "msg_uid": "42:26056",
          "day": 1,
          "legacy_words": [
            "雪"
          ],
          "v2_is_weather": true,
          "v2_kept_strong": [
            "雪"
          ],
          "v2_kept_words": [],
          "v2_kept_phrases": [],
          "v2_dropped": [],
          "v2_borderline_only": false,
          "body": "腌笃鲜回炉这主意好，老周家那笋我认得，根根都是黄泥拱出来的，炖到后头比肉还鲜。你肯再试，我摊子后头那坛子雪里蕻你拿去，就搁在秤底下，回头你顺路拎走。"
        },
        {
          "msg_uid": "42:27136",
          "day": 1,
          "legacy_words": [
            "雨"
          ],
          "v2_is_weather": true,
          "v2_kept_strong": [
            "雨"
          ],
          "v2_kept_words": [],
          "v2_kept_phrases": [],
          "v2_dropped": [],
          "v2_borderline_only": false,
          "body": "哎，红薯先搁着，我把西头老赵家那垄沟再理两锹。天要压雨。"
        },
        {
          "msg_uid": "42:28587",
          "day": 1,
          "legacy_words": [
            "雪"
          ],
          "v2_is_weather": true,
          "v2_kept_strong": [
            "雪"
          ],
          "v2_kept_words": [],
          "v2_kept_phrases": [],
          "v2_dropped": [],
          "v2_borderline_only": false,
          "body": "雪里蕻我拎走，秤底下那坛子我认得，上回你给的那半坛我拿来炒了蚕豆。这回我先把笋尖单切出来，拿你那坛子卤水吊个底，回头炖好了先给你盛一碗搁摊子边上。"
        },
        {
          "msg_uid": "42:31385",
          "day": 1,
          "legacy_words": [
            "雨"
          ],
          "v2_is_weather": true,
          "v2_kept_strong": [
            "雨"
          ],
          "v2_kept_words": [],
          "v2_kept_phrases": [],
          "v2_dropped": [],
          "v2_borderline_only": false,
          "body": "这雨要是真下来，老赵家那垄沟又得白忙活。我这儿刚把灶上那锅红薯添了把火，等会儿给你捎两块过去，你理完沟正好垫垫肚子。"
